#: ../../reference_manual/tools/gradient_edit.rst:-1
msgid "Krita's vector gradient editing tool reference."
msgstr "Opis narzędzia do edytowania wektora gradientu Krity"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/gradient_edit.rst:11
